s=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DRESS CODE POLICY</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All testers are required to be within the dress code. To ensure it is always followed, a variety of unlockable cosmetics are rewarded to testers that are looking to stand out. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688240/extras/c4396b698a3cd0893bb9bf6cb230492f.poster.avif?t=1787841425\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688240/extras/c4396b698a3cd0893bb9bf6cb230492f.webm?t=1787841425\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688240/extras/c4396b698a3cd0893bb9bf6cb230492f.mp4?t=1787841425\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EMPLOYEE BENEFITS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Employees are encouraged to explore the office during their limited company assigned break time. <br><i>*benefits are limited and TBC</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A STRICT NO-SWEARING POLICY </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Professional communications should always be conducted in the workplace. Use of inappropriate language <strong>will</strong> deduct points from your daily performance reviews.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688240/extras/e71dfb6f3a626eb5d37be66581345e2c.poster.avif?t=1787841425\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688240/extras/e71dfb6f3a626eb5d37be66581345e2c.webm?t=1787841425\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688240/extras/e71dfb6f3a626eb5d37be66581345e2c.mp4?t=1787841425\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "A first-person co-op horror experience for 1-4 players based on the thing you think it’s based on. Climb your way through testing environments as a low level QA employee for a Perfectly Legitimate Tech Company™. Survive a series of simulated assignments and brutal corporate life.", "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Traditional Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688240/b2efcc913ab5c5f48d2eea9d88858dc431bb6bd1/header.jpg?t=1787841425", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688240/548ebb587e5ead1ba9af70b74bec4d5e3525b68c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787841425", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688240/548ebb587e5ead1ba9af70b74bec4d5e3525b68c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787841425", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64 bits)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-4440 / AMD Ryzen 5 1600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 760 / AMD AMD Radeon RX 470<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 8 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements":